  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to employment creation in Mongolia (SECiM) Component 2: Piloting quality private sector work in selected livestock and vegetable value chains</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Overall objectives of the project are to: br  i) contribute to inclusive and sustainable development in Mongolia through promotion of quality employment focussing on the non-mining sector; and br  ii) contribute to enable private sector job creation where Mongolia has potential comparative advantages.</narrative>
